20:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Islamabad or Karachi: use the correct appointment instructions",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Islamabad or Karachi: use the correct appointment instructions"}],[["$","p","The official Karachi routing page lists Islamabad, Lahore, Multan and Faisalabad centres for Islamabad’s jurisdiction, and Karachi and Quetta for Karachi’s jurisdiction. The centre is not chosen simply because it has the earliest slot.",{"children":"The official Karachi routing page lists Islamabad, Lahore, Multan and Faisalabad centres for Islamabad’s jurisdiction, and Karachi and Quetta for Karachi’s jurisdiction. The centre is not chosen simply because it has the earliest slot."}],["$","p","Islamabad’s 2026/27 notice describes individual appointment allocation after university validation on Universitaly. That is a named-cycle procedure, not a promise about every future intake. Reopen your own mission’s latest instructions before booking.",{"children":"Islamabad’s 2026/27 notice describes individual appointment allocation after university validation on Universitaly. That is a named-cycle procedure, not a promise about every future intake. Reopen your own mission’s latest instructions before booking."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://conskarachi.esteri.it/en/servizi-consolari-e-visti/servizi-per-il-cittadino-straniero/visti/dove-chiedere-un-visto/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://conskarachi.esteri.it/en/servizi-consolari-e-visti/servizi-per-il-cittadino-straniero/visti/dove-chiedere-un-visto/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Karachi: where to submit and centre jurisdictions"}]]}],["$","span","https://ambislamabad.esteri.it/en/news/dall_ambasciata/2026/05/new-p